<title>UK: Microvitec in Proteon reseller deal.</title>
<headline>Microvitec in Proteon reseller deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British computer systems firm Microvitec Plc said on Monday it signed a reseller agreement with U.S. group Proteon Inc and a letter of intent for further deals to enable it to resell Proteon's products.</p>
<p>Microvitec said the deals would give it intellectual property rights for local area networking products, manufacturing licenses and access to other Proteon resources to develop products and services for local area networking.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
